{
  "packDir": "public/reader-packs/china-arrival",
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s001",
      "text": "飞机降落的时候，大卫的手心全是汗。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s002",
      "text": "他今年三十一岁，是一个美国的高中英语老师。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s003",
      "text": "从今天开始，他要在中国的一所高中教书。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s004",
      "text": "出了机场，天已经黑了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s005",
      "text": "外面又热又吵，很多人在喊。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s006",
      "text": "他打开手机上的打车软件，叫了一辆车。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s007",
      "text": "十分钟以后，一辆白色的大众停在他前面。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s008",
      "text": "是大卫吗？车牌号沪A五六七八。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s009",
      "text": "是我，麻烦您了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s010",
      "text": "司机帮他把两个大箱子放进后备箱。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s011",
      "text": "你去哪儿？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s012",
      "text": "去阳光路四十七号，是一个学校。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s013",
      "text": "阳光路啊，那有点远，走高速可以吗？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s014",
      "text": "可以，谢谢。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s015",
      "text": "车开上高速的时候，大卫看着窗外的灯。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s016",
      "text": "每一个字他都认识，可是连在一起，他就看不懂了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s017",
      "text": "你中文说得不错啊。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s018",
      "text": "没有没有，我还在学，请多指教。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s019",
      "text": "你一个人来的？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s020",
      "text": "对，我一个人来的。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s021",
      "text": "司机笑了笑，没有再说话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s022",
      "text": "四十分钟以后，车停在学校门口。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s023",
      "text": "到了，一共九十八块。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s024",
      "text": "大卫扫码付了钱，拉着箱子走进那个陌生的校园。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch01-s025",
      "text": "他心里想：从今天开始，我的生活都是中文了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch01-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s001",
      "text": "第二天早上七点，大卫就醒了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s002",
      "text": "他的房间很小，只有一张床、一个桌子和一个空空的柜子。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s003",
      "text": "八点，他去办公室找王老师。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s004",
      "text": "你好，你就是新来的英语老师吧？我姓王。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s005",
      "text": "王老师好，我叫大卫。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s006",
      "text": "别紧张，我教你怎么用这里的系统。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s007",
      "text": "这是你的课表，你这周有十二节课。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s008",
      "text": "请问办公室在几楼？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s009",
      "text": "三楼，你的座位在窗户旁边。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s010",
      "text": "第一节课是高二三班。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s011",
      "text": "教室里有四十五个学生，他们都看着他。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s012",
      "text": "同学们好，我们开始上课。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s013",
      "text": "没有人说话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s014",
      "text": "请把书翻到第二十页。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s015",
      "text": "学生们翻书的声音像下雨一样。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s016",
      "text": "有没有人愿意回答这个问题？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s017",
      "text": "还是没有人举手。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s018",
      "text": "大卫觉得自己站在一个很大的房间里，一个人说话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s019",
      "text": "下课以后，他问王老师：他们是不是不喜欢我？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s020",
      "text": "不是，他们只是害羞，不太敢说话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s021",
      "text": "你给他们一点时间。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s022",
      "text": "大卫点点头，可是心里还是很难受。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s023",
      "text": "中午他去食堂吃饭。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s024",
      "text": "他不知道那些菜叫什么名字，就指了两个看起来好吃的。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch02-s025",
      "text": "那天晚上，他很早就睡了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch02-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s001",
      "text": "十一月，天气一下子冷了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s002",
      "text": "大卫的房间没有暖气，晚上冷得睡不着。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s003",
      "text": "你在淘宝上买一床厚被子吧，很便宜。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s004",
      "text": "那天晚上，大卫第一次打开淘宝。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s005",
      "text": "屏幕上全是他不认识的词。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s006",
      "text": "满一百减二十，包邮，预售，秒杀。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s007",
      "text": "这些字我都认识，可是我不知道是什么意思。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s008",
      "text": "他找到一床被子，评分四点八，两万多人买过。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s009",
      "text": "他看了一下买家评价，大家都说很暖和。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s010",
      "text": "他点了加入购物车，然后点了立即购买。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s011",
      "text": "屏幕上跳出来一行字：请选择尺码和颜色。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s012",
      "text": "他选了一米八的，灰色的。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s013",
      "text": "然后是：请确认收货地址。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s014",
      "text": "大卫把学校的地址复制进去，可是他不太确定对不对。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s015",
      "text": "他也不知道自己的手机号有没有填错。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s016",
      "text": "最后他点了微信支付，输入了支付密码。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s017",
      "text": "订单成功了，页面上写着：预计三天后送达。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s018",
      "text": "三天，我只要再冷三个晚上。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s019",
      "text": "他还顺便买了一个小电暖气和一双拖鞋。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s020",
      "text": "第二天，物流信息显示：卖家已发货。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s021",
      "text": "第三天，显示：运输中。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s022",
      "text": "第四天，还是运输中。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s023",
      "text": "第五天早上，他的手机响了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s024",
      "text": "是一个他不认识的号码。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch03-s025",
      "text": "大卫看着屏幕，心跳得很快。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch03-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s001",
      "text": "他接了电话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s002",
      "text": "喂，您好，我是顺丰快递的。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s003",
      "text": "你好。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s004",
      "text": "您有一个快递，现在方便签收吗？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s005",
      "text": "那个人说得很快，大卫只听懂了快递两个字。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s006",
      "text": "不好意思，我的中文不太好，能说慢一点吗？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s007",
      "text": "我说，您有一个快递！您在几栋几单元？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s008",
      "text": "对不起，我没听清楚。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s009",
      "text": "几栋！几单元！",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s010",
      "text": "大卫的脸红了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s011",
      "text": "他知道几是什么意思，可是栋和单元他从来没学过。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s012",
      "text": "我住在学校里面。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s013",
      "text": "学校里面哪里？我到门口了，保安不让进。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s014",
      "text": "对不起，请再说一遍。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s015",
      "text": "电话那边安静了两秒钟。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s016",
      "text": "那我放到驿站，您自己去取，好吗？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s017",
      "text": "大卫听懂了驿站和取。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s018",
      "text": "好的，谢谢您。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s019",
      "text": "取件码我发到您手机上了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s020",
      "text": "电话挂了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s021",
      "text": "大卫坐在椅子上，看着自己的手。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s022",
      "text": "他教了九年英语，从来没有觉得自己这么笨。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s023",
      "text": "手机响了一下，来了一条短信。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s024",
      "text": "上面写着：您的包裹已到阳光路驿站，取件码八四二七，请及时取件。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch04-s025",
      "text": "他把这条短信读了五遍。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch04-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s001",
      "text": "星期六早上，大卫去找那个驿站。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s002",
      "text": "驿站在学校后门旁边，是一个很小的店。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s003",
      "text": "里面全是货架，货架上全是包裹。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s004",
      "text": "一个四十多岁的女人坐在门口，一边看手机一边吃早饭。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s005",
      "text": "你好，我来取快递。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s006",
      "text": "取件码？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Gacrux",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s007",
      "text": "八四二七。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s008",
      "text": "女人在电脑上打了几个字，然后摇摇头。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s009",
      "text": "没有这个码。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Gacrux",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s010",
      "text": "有的，短信上有。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s011",
      "text": "他把手机拿给她看。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s012",
      "text": "这是昨天的码，昨天的件已经被人取走了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Gacrux",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s013",
      "text": "被人取走了？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s014",
      "text": "对，系统上写着已签收。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Gacrux",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s015",
      "text": "大卫的心一下子沉下去。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s016",
      "text": "可是我没有取。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s017",
      "text": "那我也没办法，你去找快递公司。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Gacrux",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s018",
      "text": "后面排队的人越来越多。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s019",
      "text": "有人小声说：这个外国人怎么这么慢。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s020",
      "text": "大卫想说很多话，可是一句都说不出来。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s021",
      "text": "他只会说我没有取，说了三遍。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s022",
      "text": "好了好了，你先站到旁边，我先给他们弄。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Gacrux",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s023",
      "text": "大卫站到旁边，看着一个又一个人拿着包裹走出去。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s024",
      "text": "外面开始下雨了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch05-s025",
      "text": "他没有带伞，就那样走回了学校。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch05-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s001",
      "text": "星期一的第一节课，大卫的心情还是不好。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s002",
      "text": "他站在讲台上，看见最后一排的小林低着头。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s003",
      "text": "小林的手在桌子下面，一直在动。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s004",
      "text": "小林，请你读一下这个句子。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s005",
      "text": "小林抬起头，什么也没说。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s006",
      "text": "你上课在玩手机吗？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s007",
      "text": "教室里一下子安静了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s008",
      "text": "小林把手机放在桌子上，脸很红。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s009",
      "text": "把手机给我，下课来办公室拿。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s010",
      "text": "大卫的声音比他想的大。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s011",
      "text": "小林站起来，把手机给了他，然后坐下，没有再抬头。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s012",
      "text": "那节课剩下的三十分钟，没有一个学生说话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s013",
      "text": "下课以后，小林没有来办公室。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s014",
      "text": "王老师走过来，坐在他旁边。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s015",
      "text": "我听说了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s016",
      "text": "他上课玩手机，我不能不管。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s017",
      "text": "我知道。可是你看一下他的手机。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s018",
      "text": "大卫打开那个手机。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s019",
      "text": "屏幕上是一个翻译软件。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s020",
      "text": "上面有一句话：老师说的paragraph是什么意思？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s021",
      "text": "下面还有二十多句，全是他这几节课说过的英语。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s022",
      "text": "大卫拿着那个手机，很久没有说话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s023",
      "text": "小林的英语是全班最差的，可是他每节课都在查。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s024",
      "text": "他不敢问你，因为他觉得自己太笨了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch06-s025",
      "text": "大卫想起了那个驿站，想起了自己说不出话的样子。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch06-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s001",
      "text": "那天晚上又下雨了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s002",
      "text": "大卫没有出去吃饭，他在美团上点了一份外卖。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s003",
      "text": "那家店评分四点八，起送价二十块，配送费五块。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s004",
      "text": "他点了一个套餐，还加了一份米饭。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s005",
      "text": "备注上他写：不要辣，不要香菜。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s006",
      "text": "页面上写着：预计三十分钟送达。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s007",
      "text": "三十分钟过去了，四十分钟过去了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s008",
      "text": "一个小时以后，他的手机响了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s009",
      "text": "您好，我是美团外卖的，您的餐到了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Iapetus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s010",
      "text": "我在教师宿舍三号楼。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s011",
      "text": "我按门铃没人应。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Iapetus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s012",
      "text": "请问您在哪个楼？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s013",
      "text": "三号楼啊，门口写着三号楼。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Iapetus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s014",
      "text": "大卫拿着伞跑下去，门口一个人也没有。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s015",
      "text": "他才发现，学校有两个三号楼：一个是宿舍，一个是教学楼。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s016",
      "text": "不好意思，您是不是在教学楼那边？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s017",
      "text": "对啊，我在教学楼门口。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Iapetus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s018",
      "text": "那个是教室，我住在后面的宿舍楼。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s019",
      "text": "电话那边的人叹了一口气。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s020",
      "text": "我这边还有六个单，我给您放在前台了，您自己拿吧。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Iapetus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s021",
      "text": "电话挂了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s022",
      "text": "大卫跑到教学楼，饭已经凉了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s023",
      "text": "他坐在楼梯上，把凉了的饭吃完。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s024",
      "text": "雨打在窗户上，声音很大。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch07-s025",
      "text": "那是他来中国以后，最想回家的一个晚上。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch07-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s001",
      "text": "星期五下午，学校要开家长会。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s002",
      "text": "小林的妈妈想跟你聊一聊。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s003",
      "text": "家长会在城东的一个校区，离学校有二十公里。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s004",
      "text": "大卫提前一个小时叫了车。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s005",
      "text": "你去哪里？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s006",
      "text": "去东风路二十号，麻烦您。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s007",
      "text": "东风路有两个二十号，你去哪个？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s008",
      "text": "我…我不知道。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s009",
      "text": "大卫把手机上的地址给他看。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s010",
      "text": "这个地址导航不到啊。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s011",
      "text": "车在路上开了很久。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s012",
      "text": "四点半，路上开始堵车。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s013",
      "text": "大概还要多久？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s014",
      "text": "说不好，这个点最堵。能不能走小路？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Orus",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s015",
      "text": "可以，麻烦您。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s016",
      "text": "五点十分，车停在一个门口。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s017",
      "text": "大卫下了车，才发现这里是一个医院。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s018",
      "text": "师傅，这不是学校。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s019",
      "text": "可是车已经开走了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s020",
      "text": "他站在路边，雨又开始下了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s021",
      "text": "他打开手机，给王老师发了一条微信：我坐错车了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s022",
      "text": "五点四十，他终于走进那个教室。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s023",
      "text": "里面只剩下两个人：王老师，和一个很累的女人。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s024",
      "text": "你就是那个把我儿子手机拿走的老师吧。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Kore",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch08-s025",
      "text": "大卫站在门口，身上全是雨水。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch08-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s001",
      "text": "大卫坐下来，深深地吸了一口气。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s002",
      "text": "对不起，我迟到了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s003",
      "text": "也对不起，那天我不应该那样对小林说话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s004",
      "text": "他说得很慢，每一个字都想了很久。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s005",
      "text": "他回家哭了。他从小学就怕英语。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Kore",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s006",
      "text": "他爸爸在外地打工，一年回来两次。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Kore",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s007",
      "text": "我不懂英语，帮不了他。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Kore",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s008",
      "text": "女人的声音很小，可是大卫全听懂了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s009",
      "text": "那天他不是在玩手机。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s010",
      "text": "他在查我说的每一个单词。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s011",
      "text": "女人抬起头，看着他。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s012",
      "text": "真的吗？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Kore",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s013",
      "text": "真的。他很努力，是我错了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s014",
      "text": "王老师帮他翻译了几句他说不清楚的话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s015",
      "text": "说到一半，大卫停下来，笑了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s016",
      "text": "王老师，你现在做的事，就是小林那天做的事。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s017",
      "text": "王老师也笑了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s018",
      "text": "我在中国这三个月，很多话我也听不懂。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s019",
      "text": "电话我不敢接，快递我取不到，外卖我也拿错过。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s020",
      "text": "我知道那种感觉。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s021",
      "text": "女人看着他，很久没有说话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s022",
      "text": "老师，那你以后…多说一点慢的英语，好吗？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Kore",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s023",
      "text": "好，我们一起慢一点。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s024",
      "text": "走出教室的时候，天已经黑了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch09-s025",
      "text": "我送你回去，我们坐地铁，比打车快。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch09-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s001",
      "text": "第二个星期一，大卫把手机还给了小林。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s002",
      "text": "小林，以后有听不懂的，你可以举手问我。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s003",
      "text": "我的中文也不好，我们两个人一样。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s004",
      "text": "全班都笑了，这是三个月来第一次。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s005",
      "text": "老师，paragraph是什么意思？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Puck",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s006",
      "text": "大卫在黑板上画了一个大大的方块，全班又笑了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s007",
      "text": "从那天开始，小林每节课都举手。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s008",
      "text": "有时候问单词，有时候帮大卫翻译一句中文。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s009",
      "text": "十二月的一个下午，大卫又接到一个电话。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s010",
      "text": "喂，您好，我是顺丰快递的。您还记得我吗？",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s011",
      "text": "是上次那个人。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s012",
      "text": "您那个被子，上个月被别人取错了，我们找了很久。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s013",
      "text": "今天找到了，我现在给您送上门。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s014",
      "text": "太好了！我在教师宿舍三号楼，不是教学楼的三号楼。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s015",
      "text": "好，我知道了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Fenrir",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s016",
      "text": "二十分钟以后，一个穿蓝色衣服的男人拉着一个大箱子上来了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s017",
      "text": "我姓张，以后您的快递都是我送。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Algieba",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s018",
      "text": "张师傅，麻烦您了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Charon",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s019",
      "text": "您把楼号写清楚一点，我下次就不会跑错了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Algieba",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s020",
      "text": "大卫拿出手机，请他帮忙把地址一个字一个字地改好。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s021",
      "text": "那天晚上，王老师叫他去家里吃饭。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s022",
      "text": "桌子上有一大碗热汤，还有小林最喜欢的红烧肉。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s023",
      "text": "小林和他妈妈也在。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s024",
      "text": "大卫，你尝尝这个，不辣的。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s025",
      "text": "大卫喝了一口汤，觉得整个人都暖了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s026",
      "text": "他想起刚到中国的那个晚上，他一个人坐在车里，看着窗外的灯。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s026.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "china-arrival-ch10-s027",
      "text": "那些灯还是那些灯，可是现在，他知道下面住着谁了。",
      "voice": "cmn-CN-Chirp3-HD-Vindemiatrix",
      "file": "audio/sentences/china-arrival-ch10-s027.mp3"
    }
  ]
}
